# remote-stack-health-tick
owner: local-server-health-check · cadence: every 30m · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that pings your remote inference stack (nginx :8080, model server :8100 over Tailscale) every 30m and alerts you only when an endpoint drops or GPU memory spikes?**

## Prompt
Probe nginx :8080 and model server :8100, confirm Tailscale reachability from the Mac, and snapshot GPU memory per process; message Chris only if an endpoint is down, a process is consuming abnormal VRAM, or a background process has exited with code 7 or an OOM code.

## Evidence
> nginx is up on 8080, model server healthy on 8100, Tailscale reachable from Mac.
